      "pdfPages": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0027",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s03-p011-01650-s003",
      "sentenceText": "His 2015 autobiography was fittingly entitled On the Move: A Life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "d65d824e28df01be6ee362e5f43137f7731d455b00c8ce28197dd1cd17a44318",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s03-p011-01650-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-051",
      "parentFingerprint": "04dfa40c5b3dfdece105eb6a66888fc48261fe5a6bcd86456d2d7c956186c187",
      "passageSha256": "c212792daf0e7d748c1592a72f57a82545c829abc11ff2fa4dc835d1b0a201c5",
      "pdfPages": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0028",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s03-p011-03795-s001",
      "sentenceText": "A good analogy is dark vs. sweet chocolate.",
      "sentenceSha256": "49b2a658d28af8d8bd7b634264af1c98a8b0fa109c7af8b1312934ab533c6924",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s03-p011-03795-r001-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-019",
      "parentFingerprint": "39af3cf3791efd9c8cb229c5cb55ba76c36c02fa471c160cd5cd75ad337108fd",
      "passageSha256": "fe0b951c2e1c3a2404743d7414c711f919d57f5a254c3326b3e26a151478a447",
      "pdfPages": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0029",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s03-p011-03795-s002",
      "sentenceText": "When you eat a fine, dark chocolate, you immediately notice that it is different from a typical, sugary chocolate.",
      "sentenceSha256": "f684bb6579f806e4f09eadf74c986ecda1122ec0d8dacf3ec8b73e2f69b06bd6",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s03-p011-03795-r001-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-019",
      "parentFingerprint": "39af3cf3791efd9c8cb229c5cb55ba76c36c02fa471c160cd5cd75ad337108fd",
      "passageSha256": "fe0b951c2e1c3a2404743d7414c711f919d57f5a254c3326b3e26a151478a447",
      "pdfPages": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0030",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s03-p011-03795-s005",
      "sentenceText": "In other words, it’s rich.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8d7e1c710960822d4186e2d704b935c98d306881a193e00dbf0ba6a0eeec503c",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s03-p011-03795-r001-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-019",
      "parentFingerprint": "39af3cf3791efd9c8cb229c5cb55ba76c36c02fa471c160cd5cd75ad337108fd",
      "passageSha256": "fe0b951c2e1c3a2404743d7414c711f919d57f5a254c3326b3e26a151478a447",
      "pdfPages": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0031",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s03-p011-03795-s007",
      "sentenceText": "It has a variety of qualities, not just good or bad.",
      "sentenceSha256": "4e2bdce47ab18d19abfe8d4b6f533aaa44f26b84c6e46bd1bddac9f11b793974",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s03-p011-03795-r001-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-019",
      "parentFingerprint": "39af3cf3791efd9c8cb229c5cb55ba76c36c02fa471c160cd5cd75ad337108fd",
      "passageSha256": "fe0b951c2e1c3a2404743d7414c711f919d57f5a254c3326b3e26a151478a447",
      "pdfPages": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0032",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s03-p012-04612-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Over the last two decades, well-being researchers have debated the relative importance of hedonic vs. eudaimonic well-being.",
      "sentenceSha256": "dd62c6385ebd28ecd6abf5cada520f0067e921084f49b7d5071b1f04f10344ff",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s03-p012-04612-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-058",
      "parentFingerprint": "2051c09b7267f0cc633016a38134d4ae4926df1ed42a123bb6c794be94ef24ec",
      "passageSha256": "dd9026a374e26a035755e06746749d5e9badba49c66d90d6b26178259e7e4a54",
      "pdfPages": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0033",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s03-p012-04612-s002",
      "sentenceText": "For example, people who say their lives are easy tend also to say they are happy, but don’t necessarily say their lives are meaningful.",
      "sentenceSha256": "78e82dea31cf7552a8fb41a402876b72d1d0395400dcdddf618d1c149f23aaa2",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s03-p012-04612-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-058",
      "parentFingerprint": "2051c09b7267f0cc633016a38134d4ae4926df1ed42a123bb6c794be94ef24ec",
      "passageSha256": "dd9026a374e26a035755e06746749d5e9badba49c66d90d6b26178259e7e4a54",
      "pdfPages": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0034",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s03-p012-04612-s005",
      "sentenceText": "Some researchers even claimed to have found different epigenetic patterns between hedonic and eudaimonic well-being, suggesting that our very genes are expressed differently.",
      "sentenceSha256": "94f6155cb554f85e54bbe489329afc5ecdfe7071fce3ac3ca467581c8e0c7da6",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s03-p012-04612-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-022",
      "parentFingerprint": "375d7586aa47688ba1674bc2276c0c3d9a6635bc609a989a212f2b677086e7df",
      "passageSha256": "b07bf94376ab868524cd4d3c8a78a09ac9f966fa444237edd5dbfbb570019df2",
      "pdfPages": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0035",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s04-p013-00982-s003",
      "sentenceText": "But they do not capture an adventurous, unconventional, and dramatic life like Sacks’s.",
      "sentenceSha256": "eda1f2520ec2bcc3f9c7cf83d9e53c4ce91708b1dd7b337dabaa50c66c4f8909",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s04-p013-00982-r002-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-023",
      "parentFingerprint": "0c9e94326212afa2825d21ea397ba3de9de6e79882bab7a206a7f0c1e1bed569",
      "passageSha256": "236442c116e2698810e737dea6b4f4c198eea0f8a46de1266449d449e347c0ab",
      "pdfPages": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0036",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s04-p013-00982-s004",
      "sentenceText": "So psychologists have never had the adequate vocabulary to describe such a life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "f392c7ed5bfdb759d86d6b6176895081f06ff553f59af180cc587fe075b11394",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s04-p013-00982-r002-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-023",
      "parentFingerprint": "0c9e94326212afa2825d21ea397ba3de9de6e79882bab7a206a7f0c1e1bed569",
      "passageSha256": "236442c116e2698810e737dea6b4f4c198eea0f8a46de1266449d449e347c0ab",
      "pdfPages": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0037",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s04-p013-00982-s005",
      "sentenceText": "In a way, the happiness vs. meaning debates parallel debates in psychology over the most important factor in predicting intelligence: nature (genetics) or nurture (environment).",
      "sentenceSha256": "697ce7fbc45b3bf64011b63bb74a3c1fe76eeb9081c65203e82e6c7cb06251af",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s04-p013-00982-r002-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-023",
      "parentFingerprint": "0c9e94326212afa2825d21ea397ba3de9de6e79882bab7a206a7f0c1e1bed569",
      "passageSha256": "236442c116e2698810e737dea6b4f4c198eea0f8a46de1266449d449e347c0ab",
      "pdfPages": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0038",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s04-p013-03322-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Over dinner one day, my wife asked me if I could fix the broken window sash cords in our living room (our late-nineteenth-century Victorian house had original double-hung windows that still operated with sash cords).",
      "sentenceSha256": "2d79b74dab271cc98dad883a6c23cb0d228f0adf85e74edb3aebbaf8a8106538",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s04-p013-03322-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-061",
      "parentFingerprint": "7c37f0e758834a79dc1720eda1eb7810bae6d0cce07add766e9b2c160ca15484",
      "passageSha256": "53afab7f0eac123076d8dc8755abaa3264315474e792fd2504286225e43a7393",
      "pdfPages": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0039",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s04-p013-03322-s004",
      "sentenceText": "Our second son, who was in middle school, immediately responded, “Dad, that’s a fixed mindset!",
      "sentenceSha256": "9835ad8ee2ddaf855880b5b18d9e03a7bb62d65fb7ae4bc52096fede6a549413",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s04-p013-03322-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-061",
      "parentFingerprint": "7c37f0e758834a79dc1720eda1eb7810bae6d0cce07add766e9b2c160ca15484",
      "passageSha256": "53afab7f0eac123076d8dc8755abaa3264315474e792fd2504286225e43a7393",
      "pdfPages": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0040",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s04-p013-05662-s001",
      "sentenceText": "How, then, is psychological richness different from happiness and meaning?",
      "sentenceSha256": "fddb1f49e4d3c96a736829c9977e6301941686b0074cde2d4f53508e9c3b5cd8",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s04-p013-05662-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-064",
      "parentFingerprint": "1cf2be9bbb4426ba8531a6d0b84bdb8f3e411e4a2dc8cfd1e3c00686b716e8b7",
      "passageSha256": "3ade3aed167035bbee9245c91e00d86da420996ed88b53669379fc863a779aff",
      "pdfPages": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0041",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s04-p013-05662-s002",
      "sentenceText": "The main body of my book answers this question in detail (see Table 1 for a brief summary).",
      "sentenceSha256": "90ba502a93f48e7e68d19b3ea4a4e99200d90cbf110aa703cdef9871143ab5aa",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s04-p013-05662-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-064",
      "parentFingerprint": "1cf2be9bbb4426ba8531a6d0b84bdb8f3e411e4a2dc8cfd1e3c00686b716e8b7",
      "passageSha256": "3ade3aed167035bbee9245c91e00d86da420996ed88b53669379fc863a779aff",
      "pdfPages": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0042",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s04-p013-05662-s011",
      "sentenceText": "In another sense, happiness is like your batting average in baseball.",
      "sentenceSha256": "d6301b566234e98ae2734134da54aea827bcf2a0fd1a2c5a638569a3bb25ccf4",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s04-p013-05662-r011-015",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-025",
      "parentFingerprint": "e154d36f6f67315ccffede3a603ea16b6bd82447c97f59472520594103ac9f09",
      "passageSha256": "68cbe6a276ad0415eacc081bffd64062335ecdbbfde8a6d428b2af00494563a0",
      "pdfPages": [
        13,
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0043",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s04-p013-05662-s012",
      "sentenceText": "It goes up and down, but what matters most is the frequency of your hits.",
      "sentenceSha256": "0b4e89914e1a93feb93efd3c9f3b15b7421f1b3fa6ec20f1bf106345eb5c7b3d",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s04-p013-05662-r011-015",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-025",
      "parentFingerprint": "e154d36f6f67315ccffede3a603ea16b6bd82447c97f59472520594103ac9f09",
      "passageSha256": "68cbe6a276ad0415eacc081bffd64062335ecdbbfde8a6d428b2af00494563a0",
      "pdfPages": [
        13,
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0044",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s04-p013-05662-s013",
      "sentenceText": "An infield hit is as worthy as a huge home run when it comes to the batting average.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a6e1123449d9b279e8802ace51447d2dd5e7e1d588f8e5abbd1ece98b6508835",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s04-p013-05662-r011-015",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-025",
      "parentFingerprint": "e154d36f6f67315ccffede3a603ea16b6bd82447c97f59472520594103ac9f09",
      "passageSha256": "68cbe6a276ad0415eacc081bffd64062335ecdbbfde8a6d428b2af00494563a0",
      "pdfPages": [
        13,
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0045",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s04-p013-05662-s014",
      "sentenceText": "You should aim for as many hits as possible.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8f4a1596657d1b8996c84b5358fe2b98d9398ee53a81a345084fec508ce1f816",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s04-p013-05662-r011-015",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-025",
      "parentFingerprint": "e154d36f6f67315ccffede3a603ea16b6bd82447c97f59472520594103ac9f09",
      "passageSha256": "68cbe6a276ad0415eacc081bffd64062335ecdbbfde8a6d428b2af00494563a0",
      "pdfPages": [
        13,
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0046",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s04-p014-01530-s002",
      "sentenceText": "In The Varieties of Religious Experience, William James declared, “To begin with, how can things so insecure as the successful experiences of this world afford a stable anchorage?",
      "sentenceSha256": "21d12c46d4d47181cbf1906b245e8dfdf45b6e189e2e41546b2fb734dd3c12fb",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s04-p014-01530-r001-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-026",
      "parentFingerprint": "df2f00df28089664746e30a5d81b3c527a39c2c5bc4f1d23528fd7b05e5c3c82",
      "passageSha256": "33fad365702c79d6a415fd932adbf0f825c993138a4ebf9e34982702237bfb2e",
      "pdfPages": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0047",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s04-p014-01530-s003",
      "sentenceText": "A chain is no stronger than its weakest link, and life is after all a chain.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8f7d7e4a97fffa3f0d4804aeeebb09e3abba478f98aa5bd76e5b6be6e3ee8ad1",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s04-p014-01530-r001-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-026",
      "parentFingerprint": "df2f00df28089664746e30a5d81b3c527a39c2c5bc4f1d23528fd7b05e5c3c82",
      "passageSha256": "33fad365702c79d6a415fd932adbf0f825c993138a4ebf9e34982702237bfb2e",
      "pdfPages": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0048",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s04-p014-01530-s004",
      "sentenceText": "In the healthiest and most prosperous existence, how many links of illness, danger, and disaster are always interposed?”",
      "sentenceSha256": "1247b410b1ce2fc8f90888bb8652dcba7c4e6efa2ec774865a7f9b3bd19cc09e",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s04-p014-01530-r001-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-026",
      "parentFingerprint": "df2f00df28089664746e30a5d81b3c527a39c2c5bc4f1d23528fd7b05e5c3c82",
      "passageSha256": "33fad365702c79d6a415fd932adbf0f825c993138a4ebf9e34982702237bfb2e",
      "pdfPages": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0049",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s04-p014-01530-s005",
      "sentenceText": "So it goes.",
      "sentenceSha256": "314a1c2d9193afbc99b86a1e2d92811ea00cb857b37255ee9221294c6209b6cd",
      "readingUnitId": "c01-s04-p014-01530-r001-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c01-026",
      "parentFingerprint": "df2f00df28089664746e30a5d81b3c527a39c2c5bc4f1d23528fd7b05e5c3c82",
      "passageSha256": "33fad365702c79d6a415fd932adbf0f825c993138a4ebf9e34982702237bfb2e",
      "pdfPages": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c01-0050",
      "sentenceId": "c01-s04-p014-01530-s006",
